{"seq":2,"slug":"container-uld-3d-loading-weight","title":"集装箱/ULD 三维装箱与重心配平","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/pallet-container-loading/container-uld-3d-loading-weight","wordCount":1858,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"集装箱-uld-三维装箱与重心配平\">集装箱/ULD 三维装箱与重心配平</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把托盘单元放进集装箱或航空 ULD，是装载链条的最后一次聚合，也是单次决策金额最大的一次：少装一垛就是几百到上千美元的运力浪费，装歪了则可能触发翻车、压坏或码头拒收。这一层要同时满足三类约束——<strong>几何</strong>（装得进）、<strong>重量</strong>（不超载、不超单点集中载荷）、<strong>力学</strong>（重心在安全区、载荷分布均衡）。</p>\n<p>与箱内装箱相比，这里有一个关键区别：集装箱的<strong>门洞小于箱体</strong>。20 尺柜内长近 12 米，但门宽与门高都比内宽内高小，意味着不能简单按&quot;内尺寸能容纳&quot;判断，最后一排的装载顺序和推进方向都要受门洞约束。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[托盘单元清单] --&gt; B[载具型谱匹配]&#10;  B --&gt; C[载具内尺寸/门洞/载重]&#10;  C --&gt; D[三维装箱搜索]&#10;  D --&gt; E[重心估算]&#10;  E --&gt; F{重心在安全区?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[重货前移/轻货后置]&#10;  G --&gt; D&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H{单点集中载荷合规?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[加垫板/分散]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[生成装载图与配载单]\">graph TD\n  A[托盘单元清单] --&gt; B[载具型谱匹配]\n  B --&gt; C[载具内尺寸/门洞/载重]\n  C --&gt; D[三维装箱搜索]\n  D --&gt; E[重心估算]\n  E --&gt; F{重心在安全区?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[重货前移/轻货后置]\n  G --&gt; D\n  F --&gt;|是| H{单点集中载荷合规?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[加垫板/分散]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[生成装载图与配载单]</pre><h2 id=\"载具规格\">载具规格</h2><h3 id=\"集装箱\">集装箱</h3><p>集装箱的分类、尺寸与额定值由 ISO 668 定义，规格与试验由 ISO 1496 定义。常见的几种内尺寸与最大总重如下（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Intermodal_container\">Intermodal container</a> 对 ISO 668:2020 第八版及尺寸表的引用）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>ISO 尺寸码</th>\n<th>内长 (m)</th>\n<th>内宽 (m)</th>\n<th>内高 (m)</th>\n<th>最大总重</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>20 尺标准</td>\n<td>1CC</td>\n<td>5.867</td>\n<td>2.330</td>\n<td>2.350</td>\n<td>36,000 kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>40 尺标准</td>\n<td>1AA</td>\n<td>11.998</td>\n<td>2.489</td>\n<td>2.350</td>\n<td>36,000 kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>40 尺高柜</td>\n<td>1AAA</td>\n<td>11.998</td>\n<td>2.489</td>\n<td>2.654</td>\n<td>36,000 kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>45 尺高柜</td>\n<td>1BBB</td>\n<td>13.541</td>\n<td>2.489</td>\n<td>2.718</td>\n<td>36,000 kg</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>除 10 尺外的标准箱最大总重均为 36,000kg（约 79,000 lb），这一额度来自 2016 年对 ISO 668:2013 的修订，并在 2020 年第八版中保持。<strong>最大总重是箱体加货物的合计</strong>，所以可用载重 = 最大总重 − 箱自重。20 尺柜箱自重通常在 2.2 吨量级，40 尺柜在 3.7–4.8 吨量级，具体以箱体门上的 CSC 铭牌为准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"门洞与推进约束\">门洞与推进约束</h3><p>装载顺序必须与门洞匹配：如果先放了最里面的大垛，后面的小垛可能因门洞窄而推不进去。实务上的解法是<strong>从里到外装载</strong>，并把这一步作为装箱算法的硬性顺序约束，而不是事后再检。这也是装载问题比箱内装箱复杂的地方——它有方向性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"航空-uld\">航空 ULD</h3><p>航空货运使用 ULD（Unit Load Device），即用来装载行李、货运与邮件的容器；一个用货网固定好的航空货板同样构成 ULD。常见基座规格包括 LD3（IATA 基座码 K，1534mm × 1562mm，即 AKE 箱）、LD6 与 LD11（基座码 L，1534mm × 3175mm，一个 LD6 或 LD11 可占据两个 LD3 的位置），以及 88×125 英寸与 96×125 英寸的大货板（LD7/PMC），见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unit_load_device\">Unit load device</a> 对 IATA 基座码的引用。ULD 的轮廓是非矩形的（上沿收窄以贴合货舱弧线），所以判定不能只用长方体包含，必须按轮廓剖面校验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三维装载算法\">三维装载算法</h2><h3 id=\"与箱内装箱的差异\">与箱内装箱的差异</h3><p>装载层的问题规模更大但结构更规整：件数少（一个 40 尺柜通常 20–30 垛）、每件体积大、且多数情况下<strong>不可旋转</strong>（托盘必须正放）。这反而使问题更容易——搜索空间被约束显著缩小。主流做法仍是极端点 + 分层，但要在层内加入&quot;按卸货顺序分区&quot;的约束。</p>\n<h3 id=\"卸货顺序与分区\">卸货顺序与分区</h3><p>多卸点（multi-drop）场景下，后卸的货必须在里、先卸的在外，否则到了第一个卸点要把整柜货搬出来。这在几何上等价于沿柜长方向划分若干区段，每个区段对应一个卸点，区段内不再跨区混合。加上这个约束后，问题的可行解会明显减少——这也是为什么多卸点的装载率总是低于单卸点，这个差异应当在指标上被单独度量而不是混在一起考核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重心与配平\">重心与配平</h2><h3 id=\"纵向与横向重心\">纵向与横向重心</h3><p>载具的稳定性取决于合成重心位置。工程上用两个无量纲量表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{cog} = \\frac{\\sum_i m_i x_i}{\\sum_i m_i}, \\qquad y_{cog} = \\frac{\\sum_i m_i y_i}{\\sum_i m_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>纵向（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>）重心通常要求落在柜体长度中段附近的一个区间内（例如中段 ±10% 以内，具体阈值按承运人与箱型规定），横向（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>）重心则要求尽量贴近中线，因为横向偏心会显著加剧侧倾风险。这两个量都必须在装箱过程中<strong>增量估算</strong>，而不是装完再算——装完了再发现配平不合规，只能返工。</p>\n<h3 id=\"增量维护重心\">增量维护重心</h3><p>一个实用的实现是维护累加量而不是反复求和：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class LoadingState:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.mass = 0.0&#10;        self.mx = 0.0&#10;        self.my = 0.0&#10;        self.mz = 0.0&#10;&#10;    def add(self, unit):&#10;        m = unit.gross_weight_kg&#10;        self.mass += m&#10;        self.mx += m * unit.center_x&#10;        self.my += m * unit.center_y&#10;        self.mz += m * unit.center_z&#10;&#10;    def cog(self):&#10;        return (self.mx / self.mass, self.my / self.mass, self.mz / self.mass)&#10;&#10;    def side_ratio(self):&#10;        # 横向偏心：重心偏离中线距离 / 内宽&#10;        return abs(self.cog()[1] - self.inner_w / 2) / self.inner_w\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoadingState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mass </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.my </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, unit):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit.gross_weight_kg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mass </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit.center_x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.my </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit.center_y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit.center_z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mass, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.my </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mass, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mass)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> side_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 横向偏心：重心偏离中线距离 / 内宽</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cog()[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.inner_w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.inner_w</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个 O(1) 的增量维护让算法可以在每一步放置后立刻判断配平是否越界，从而在搜索中剪掉坏分支，而不是等到最后才知道方案不可行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单点集中载荷\">单点集中载荷</h3><p>除总重与重心外，集装箱地板还有<strong>单点集中载荷</strong>限制：叉车轮胎或重货的接触面积过小会压坏地板。合规手段是加铺垫板增大接触面积，或在装箱算法里限制&quot;该位置承载&quot;的等效压强。这条约束在小件整托装载中通常不触发，但在装载机械设备或钢卷一类重货时是决定性的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重量合规\">重量合规</h2><h3 id=\"vgm-与法定申报\">VGM 与法定申报</h3><p>海运有一个不可绕过的合规步骤：SOLAS 要求为每个装船集装箱提供<strong>核实总重</strong>（Verified Gross Mass, VGM），由托运人负责取得并签署，且在装船前提供，否则集装箱不得装船。这条规则自 2016 年 7 月 1 日起生效。取得方式只有两条路：方法一是直接称量已装箱的集装箱；方法二是在取得认证的货物与包装重量基础上累加计算。装载系统输出的整柜重量必须与申报 VGM 一致，且<strong>任何装载后的增减都必须触发重新申报</strong>——这是&quot;装完再塞两件&quot;这个动作真正的代价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与装载算法的职责划分\">与装载算法的职责划分</h3><p>装载算法这一侧能做的，是让预测总重尽量贴近实测：托盘自重、缠绕膜重量、垫木重量、箱内填充物重量都要计入模型。漏掉托盘与薄膜这类&quot;看起来不重要&quot;的项，一个 30 垛的柜子就能差出上百公斤，正好落在申报误差的敏感区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>载具装载同时受几何、重量、力学三类约束；集装箱门洞小于箱体，装载必须有方向性。</li>\n<li>标准箱最大总重 36,000kg（除 10 尺），可用载重需减去箱自重，以 CSC 铭牌为准。</li>\n<li>航空 ULD 轮廓非矩形，需按剖面而非长方体校验；LD6/LD11 占两个 LD3 位。</li>\n<li>多卸点分区会降低装载率，这个损失应单独度量而不是混入单卸点考核。</li>\n<li>重心用增量累加 O(1) 维护，让配平约束能在搜索中即时剪枝。</li>\n<li>SOLAS VGM 要求托运人在装船前申报核实总重，装载后重量变化必须重新申报。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸\">延伸</h2><p>单元本身怎么码出来见 <a href=\"pallet-pattern-unitization-wrapping\">托盘堆码/缠绕/规格与单元化</a>；哪些货不可相邻、哪些不可被压，见 <a href=\"mixed-load-separation-stack-limit\">混装隔离与限重/堆叠约束</a>；装载率如何作为指标考核，见 <a href=\"../cost-damage-balance/lightweighting-load-rate-metric\">减材轻量化与装载率指标</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"集装箱/ULD 三维装箱与重心配平","id":"集装箱-uld-三维装箱与重心配平"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"载具规格","id":"载具规格"},{"level":3,"text":"集装箱","id":"集装箱"},{"level":3,"text":"门洞与推进约束","id":"门洞与推进约束"},{"level":3,"text":"航空 ULD","id":"航空-uld"},{"level":2,"text":"三维装载算法","id":"三维装载算法"},{"level":3,"text":"与箱内装箱的差异","id":"与箱内装箱的差异"},{"level":3,"text":"卸货顺序与分区","id":"卸货顺序与分区"},{"level":2,"text":"重心与配平","id":"重心与配平"},{"level":3,"text":"纵向与横向重心","id":"纵向与横向重心"},{"level":3,"text":"增量维护重心","id":"增量维护重心"},{"level":3,"text":"单点集中载荷","id":"单点集中载荷"},{"level":2,"text":"重量合规","id":"重量合规"},{"level":3,"text":"VGM 与法定申报","id":"vgm-与法定申报"},{"level":3,"text":"与装载算法的职责划分","id":"与装载算法的职责划分"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸","id":"延伸"}],"prev":{"title":"托盘堆码/缠绕/规格与单元化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/pallet-container-loading/pallet-pattern-unitization-wrapping"},"next":{"title":"混装隔离与限重/堆叠约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/pallet-container-loading/mixed-load-separation-stack-limit"}}